  objects: 1-7 blue 4-connected objects; mix of rim (hole-enclosing) and distractor (open) types
  rim_objects:
    count: 0-4 per grid
    shape: irregular closed ring enclosing exactly 1 4-connected black hole; L/C-shaped rims allowed, not just rectangles
